<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update -Pakistan- Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update -Pakistan- Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>KARACHI, Oct 21 - Eight vessels waiting off port. One general cargo vessel waiting for two days, four container vessels waiting for up to two days, one fertiliser vessel waiting for 12 days, one loader waiting for five days and one oil tanker waiting for three days. Eleven vessels waiting off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
